00:02:35.810 --> 00:02:38.781
laying naked in my bed and
pressing one fuckin' button.

00:02:38.781 --> 00:02:42.170
(audience laughing)

00:02:42.170 --> 00:02:44.323
Like, social time at the store, really?

00:02:45.310 --> 00:02:46.934
Like, that's not gonna play out.

00:02:46.934 --> 00:02:49.258
Like, it's just not gonna play out.

00:02:49.258 --> 00:02:51.702
You'll find other things to do.

00:02:51.702 --> 00:02:53.930
There's not gonna be a
single convenience store

00:02:53.930 --> 00:02:55.093
