00:02:57.620 --> 00:02:59.610
Like 7/11's out of business.

00:02:59.610 --> 00:03:01.023
You're not gonna go there.

00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:02.950
You're just not.

00:03:02.950 --> 00:03:04.997
You're gonna get
everything within an hour.

00:03:04.997 --> 00:03:08.720
Everything, on demand, ad hoc,
at the lowest possible cost,

00:03:08.720 --> 00:03:09.630
