00:03:09.630 --> 00:03:14.630
We hold the past on a pedestal
and we demonize the future.

00:03:14.970 --> 00:03:16.700
Like that's just not how it works.

00:03:16.700 --> 00:03:21.040
And this internet thing,
you're sleeping on it.

00:03:21.040 --> 00:03:22.680
It's bigger than you think.

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:23.690
This is it.

00:03:23.690 --> 00:03:26.690
This is the television
and radio of our society.

00:03:26.690 --> 00:03:29.490
The internet has won, there is no debate,

00:03:29.490 --> 00:03:32.993
